<!--
	Cleaned-up Actions window (176 x 206)
	Page area is 168 x 153 and tabs are 42px wide. Every page uses a 9px
	margin on all four sides.
	- Tab icons centered via Actions-only copies (A_ActWnd_*) using actwnd_tabs.dds
	- Socials: page arrows centered, 2 x 6 grid of 75x20 buttons (150 wide)
	- Main / Abilities / Combat: six 150x20 buttons with 3px gaps
-->

